    <string id="ForgetPrompt">Turn on and save to release the current Di2 and connect to the nearest one on the next scan. The switch turns itself back off.</string>
    <string id="AboutText">Di2 Field by Sergey Lapshin. Shows your Shimano Di2 gear, gear ratio and D-Fly battery over Bluetooth, and records a full ride summary (ratios, shifts, gear combos) to the activity. Setup: pick a Front/Cassette preset for a one-tap config, or choose Custom and enter the chainrings, cassette and teeth manually. A preset always overrides the manual fields. Tested with Shimano XT Di2 RD-M8250-SGS (12-speed) on Garmin Edge Explore 2. Unofficial app, not affiliated with Shimano.</string>

